<http://data.silknow.org/object/3c359ae0-4d0b-389c-93a4-e1231c6da085>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Natural linen tabby-woven ground, embroidered with heavy floss silks in cross, running and binding stitches. Each face shows a border of two rows of alternating dark red and blue-green leaf forms set at an angle, with details of the opposite color. Red and green star or rosette in center. Narrow border lines of same colors; seams formed of openwork stitches. Linen stamped with mark on both faces. Stained and patched; some green silks replaced. Linen browned."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/cdf77173-c1d7-3455-bd8e-507ca073a561> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Natural linen tabby-woven ground, embroidered with heavy floss silks in cross, running and binding stitches. Each face shows a border of two rows of alternating dark red and blue-green leaf forms set at an angle, with details of the opposite color. Red and green star or rosette in center. Narrow border lines of same colors; seams formed of openwork stitches. Linen stamped with mark on both faces. Stained and patched; some green silks replaced. Linen browned."@en ;
